# Card art downloaded by a locally run backend (see Images:Directory). On a case-insensitive
# filesystem (macOS/Windows default), this pattern also matches Data/ (the EF Core folder) —
# the negation below is required so Data/ (and anything new added under it) stays tracked.
backend/src/PtcgpTracker.Api/data/
!backend/src/PtcgpTracker.Api/Data/
